@startuml 16_state_service
[*] --> UNKNOWN
UNKNOWN --> HEALTHY : accepted successful HTTP check
UNKNOWN --> UNHEALTHY : first failed check
HEALTHY --> UNHEALTHY : latest check fails
UNHEALTHY --> HEALTHY : latest check succeeds
HEALTHY --> HEALTHY : successful check
UNHEALTHY --> UNHEALTHY : failed check
note right of UNKNOWN: Before first check, neither healthy nor unhealthy can be concluded.
@enduml
